<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
    <li><b>Pre-market alerts</b> — price alerts no longer fire against the previous day's close while pre-market or after-hours data hasn't arrived yet. An alert now waits for the real extended-hours price, so you won't get a spurious "now $1,100" notification at the previous close.</li>
